15be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7ExtenderSequence}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7ExtenderSequence}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (model extender-sequence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8109ed862a1b5d55\" href=\"?note=8109ed862a1b5d55\" title=\"58-df-zfc-model7-extender-sequence\">58-df-zfc-model7-extender-sequence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExtenderSequence}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ExtenderSequence}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}extender\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ExtenderSequence}_S(\\vec E,M) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel7ExtenderSequence}_S(\\vec E,M,\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec E))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}extender\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ExtenderSequence}_S(\\vec E,M) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel7ExtenderSequence}_S(\\vec E,M,\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec E))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Membership in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> alone does not make entries extenders; the reused predicate enforces an ordinal domain and extender-over conditions.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"d8eb5064b65f8a92","anc